.SH NAME
lean-delete - Delete a variable from a profile


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean delete KEY [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a variable from the active profile (or a named profile via --profile).
If the profile is currently active the change is also reflected in .env.

.PP
Examples:
  lean delete DEBUG
  lean delete API_KEY --profile staging


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	Target profile (defaults to active)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP


